(6215574, 917763, 77196, '<td valign="top">This is very nicely done and very creative. For me, the lighting is a bit hot on the left side of the picture (top right of cauliflower and right side of furtherest asparagus head. I really like the "apples" in the "trees". Makes me smile.</td>', 'This is very nicely done and very creative. For me, the lighting is a bit hot on the left side of the picture (top right of cauliflower and right side of furtherest asparagus head. I really like the "apples" in the "trees". Makes me smile.', '2010-11-07 22:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215578, 917268, 77196, '<td valign="top">The snow and reflections are nicely done. To me the photo feels like it isn''t level - downhill to the right. I think it is the curve of the lake and the near edge of the island that gives this feel.</td>', 'The snow and reflections are nicely done. To me the photo feels like it isn''t level - downhill to the right. I think it is the curve of the lake and the near edge of the island that gives this feel.', '2010-11-07 22:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215583, 917877, 77196, '<td valign="top">This is creative, but for me the light is too harsh, and the shot is too OOF. It does have a spooky and surreal feel to it.</td>', 'This is creative, but for me the light is too harsh, and the shot is too OOF. It does have a spooky and surreal feel to it.', '2010-11-07 22:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215587, 917860, 77196, '<td valign="top">IMO, all the "tan" army being OOF and in the foreground detracts from the shot. Also, the lighting is very harsh - with strong, well-defined shadows on the soldiers, the cloud, and the string holding up the cloud. Unless the harsh light was intentional, you can decrease the shadows a lot by using another light source on the opposite side. Your shot is creative. <br/></td>', 'IMO, all the "tan" army being OOF and in the foreground detracts from the shot. Also, the lighting is very harsh - with strong, well-defined shadows on the soldiers, the cloud, and the string holding up the cloud. Unless the harsh light was intentional, you can decrease the shadows a lot by using another light source on the opposite side. Your shot is creative. ', '2010-11-07 22:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
