(6218280, 917763, 59796, '<td valign="top">Missed out on a ribbon by 0.05! Way too close - When I last came 5th I was off by miles so I didn''t feel bad. Congratulations on a "Personal Best" and "Honorable Mention" on your profile.<br/> <br/>That fence is way too cute and the apples are fantastic! There''s a lot of depth to the image and I realized after reading your notes how much effort you put into getting that depth into your picture. Something I need to learn since my pic bothered me for lack of depth.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-11-10 00:59:43.</i></td>', 'Missed out on a ribbon by 0.05! Way too close - When I last came 5th I was off by miles so I didn''t feel bad. Congratulations on a "Personal Best" and "Honorable Mention" on your profile. That fence is way too cute and the apples are fantastic! There''s a lot of depth to the image and I realized after reading your notes how much effort you put into getting that depth into your picture. Something I need to learn since my pic bothered me for lack of depth.', '2010-11-10 00:56:48.000000', '2010-11-10 00:59:43.000000', 0),
